# 9. Step 3 – Validate Input

Never blindly trust user input.

Basic example:

```python
from urllib.parse import urlparse

target = input("Enter URL: ").strip()

if not target.startswith(("http://", "https://")):
    target = "https://" + target

parsed = urlparse(target)

print("Host:", parsed.hostname)
```

This extracts the hostname from a URL.

