# 38. Security Considerations

An OSINT tool should:

### 1. Validate input

Prevent malformed input.

### 2. Use timeouts

Avoid hanging forever.

### 3. Handle errors

Do not crash unnecessarily.

### 4. Respect rate limits

Avoid excessive requests.

### 5. Protect collected data

Reports may contain sensitive operational information.

### 6. Avoid credential collection

Never intentionally collect passwords or tokens.

### 7. Follow authorization

Only investigate targets you are permitted to investigate.

